id: pm-c90tfh
title: "The blocks ceiling counts fabricated and evidence-cited ordering edges identically, so the historical ordering reconstruction another item mandates cannot land"
description: "The dependency-kind-blocks ratchet sits at ceiling 243 with zero headroom while pm-1w6scp, pm-gxs55a and pm-ye46ns all require adding blocks rows; the selector cannot distinguish a fabricated directional edge from an evidence-cited delivery-order edge, so the two properties are mutually unsatisfiable and neither item names the conflict."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: enforcement,graph,measurement-ratchet,ordering,tracker-governance
created_at: "2026-08-10T12:11:08.571Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-20T22:10:08.700Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-20T21:47:14.380Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-20T21:47:14.380Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: "The blocks population is partitioned by provenance so an evidence-cited ordering edge and a fabricated directional edge are separately countable; The anti-fabrication property remains enforced as a ceiling over the unsourced partition, with a negative control proving it still fails; The evidence-cited partition is enforced as a floor so a later pass cannot silently delete recovered ordering; pm-1w6scp, pm-gxs55a and pm-ye46ns each carry a typed edge to this item so the dependency is readable from either side; The historical total blocks population remains bounded by a blocking outer ceiling with adjacent pass and fail controls"
goal: Provable history
objective: Make delivery sequence reconstructible by graph traversal
value: Unblocks the ordering half of the historical-spine reconstruction without giving up the anti-fabrication guarantee
impact: Three accepted items currently cannot land as specified
outcome: Ordering edges carry provenance and are enforced by a partitioned declaration
why_now: Measured at zero headroom on 2026-08-10 while the spine reconstruction is the active graph wave
parent: pm-96h7
reviewer: maintainer-review
risk: medium
confidence: high
sprint: 2026-w33
reporter: maintainer-agent
severity: high
environment: "pm 2026.8.10, 2412 items, 29 enforced measurement declarations"
resolution: "Added SDK-native provenance predicates; enforced total, uncited, and evidence-cited blocks populations with independent negative controls; encoded three evidence-cited ordering edges; and centralized direction-independent prose pair identity."
expected_result: "A bound can name the population it governs: total ordering edges stay below the historical outer ceiling, evidence-cited edges are floored, fabricated directional edges stay ceilinged, and pair identity cannot diverge between collection and lookup."
actual_result: "The public assurance SDK supports exact, prefix, present, and missing source_kind predicates. graph-composition passes with total blocks=205 at ceiling 243, uncited=202 at ceiling 202, and evidence-cited=3 at floor 3; the shared prosePairKey regression suite and full static gate pass."
