  "2026-08-20T20:56:56.950Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: all 540 test files and 7,653 tests pass with exact 100% statements (55,898/55,898), branches (41,738/41,738), functions (11,596/11,596), and lines (53,927/53,927). repository-static-quality, package boundary/parity/replication, command grammar, flag parity/lexicon, refusal closure, public SDK surface, graph-composition, record-integrity, ESLint, jscpd zero clones, secret scan, and pnpm audit all pass. Live graph-composition observes 202 uncited blocks at ceiling 202 and 3 evidence-cited blocks at floor 3."
  "2026-08-20T21:14:48.750Z","harness:codex","Final linked-test evidence: tracker-context execution passed 2/2 linked commands. An earlier schema-context run exposed the expected absence of live defect evidence; a second attempt hit host /tmp inode exhaustion (UNKNOWN -122), confirmed at 99% inode usage. Routing the sandbox through a dedicated home-backed TMPDIR produced a clean terminal pass without changing test semantics."
  "2026-08-20T21:19:04.751Z","harness:codex","Post-close gate correction: classified the unpartitioned blocks ratchet as review_caught_late and recorded structured gate_strengthened evidence. The negative control now names both protected failure directions: an uncited blocks edge above 202 and removal of an evidence-cited edge below 3."
  "2026-08-20T21:40:02.248Z","harness:codex","PR #1069 review evidence: restored blocks-total-ceiling at the historical 243 outer bound with pass=243/fail=244 controls and added it to graph-composition and tracker-context-quality. Current measurements remain total=205, uncited=202, evidence-cited=3. The module-scope prosePairKey now supplies one canonical key implementation to link collection and gap lookup."
  "2026-08-20T21:47:13.660Z","harness:codex","Final review-fix verification: 20/20 focused assurance and benchmark tests pass. Full quality:static passes repository assurance, contract snapshots, package/SDK parity, surface replication, grammar/flag/refusal gates, tracker-context-quality, graph-composition, record-integrity, public surface, and cost budgets; blocks receipts are total 205<=243, uncited 202<=202, evidence 3>=3."
  "2026-08-20T22:08:26.249Z","harness:codex","Post-merge closeout: PR #1069 merged to main as c839c4df338a51725eb54dd165ce46ef46aca8db after exact-head hosted CI, coverage, security, benchmark, and review-thread gates passed. Sentry PM-CLI-37 recorded one handled 2026.8.20 event during the implementation window when the published CLI read dependency-kind-blocks before its source existed; there was no recurrence. The merged source implements that measurement, so the Sentry issue is now resolved in exact commit c839c4df3 with regression tracking retained."
  "2026-08-20T22:10:08.700Z","harness:codex","Post-merge telemetry proof: with NODE_USE_ENV_PROXY=1, a real context action increased the durable queue from 1 to 2; telemetry flush reported queue_entries_drained=2, queue_progressed=true, queue_empty=true, zero invalid rows, and no failed flush; the endpoint health probe returned ok with zero warnings. The self-observing CLI then queued its own flush/status action, so final drainage is performed through the public SDK without generating another CLI event."
